              <td class="py-2 px-3 font-sans">₹799 - ₹713.39</td>
              <td class="py-2 px-3 text-right text-neutral-500">- ₹85.61</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="py-2 px-3 font-sans font-medium text-neutral-800">Flipkart Commission (11.5%)</td>
