              <td class="py-2 px-3 text-right text-neutral-500">- ₹91.89</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="py-2 px-3 font-sans font-medium text-neutral-800">Fixed Fee Slab</td>
              <td class="py-2 px-3 font-sans">₹501 to ₹1,000 Tier</td>
              <td class="py-2 px-3 text-right text-neutral-500">- ₹28.00</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="py-2 px-3 font-sans font-medium text-neutral-800">Payment Collection Fee (2%)</td>
              <td class="py-2 px-3 font-sans">2% of ₹799</td>
              <td class="py-2 px-3 text-right text-neutral-500">- ₹15.98</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="py-2 px-3 font-sans font-medium text-neutral-800">eKart National Courier (500g)</td>
              <td class="py-2 px-3 font-sans">Silver Tier National Delivery</td>
              <td class="py-2 px-3 text-right text-neutral-500">- ₹64.00</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="py-2 px-3 font-sans font-medium text-neutral-800">18% GST on Flipkart Services</td>
              <td class="py-2 px-3 font-sans">18% of (₹91.89 + ₹28 + ₹15.98 + ₹64)</td>
              <td class="py-2 px-3 text-right text-neutral-500">- ₹35.98</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="py-2 px-3 font-sans font-medium text-neutral-800">TCS (0.5%) + TDS (0.1%)</td>
              <td class="py-2 px-3 font-sans">0.6% on Taxable Value (₹713.39)</td>
              <td class="py-2 px-3 text-right text-neutral-500">- ₹4.28</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="bg-neutral-50 font-bold">
              <td class="py-2.5 px-3 font-sans text-neutral-900">Net Flipkart Bank Settlement</td>
              <td class="py-2.5 px-3 font-sans">Disbursed into merchant account</td>
              <td class="py-2.5 px-3 text-right text-emerald-800">₹644.48</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="py-2 px-3 font-sans font-medium text-neutral-800">Product Sourcing Cost (COGS)</td>
              <td class="py-2 px-3 font-sans">Wholesale manufacturing price</td>
              <td class="py-2 px-3 text-right text-neutral-500">- ₹320.00</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="py-2 px-3 font-sans font-medium text-neutral-800">Packaging &amp; Labeling</td>
              <td class="py-2 px-3 font-sans">Protective bubble wrap &amp; carton</td>
              <td class="py-2 px-3 text-right text-neutral-500">- ₹20.00</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="bg-emerald-50/60 font-bold text-emerald-900">
              <td class="py-2.5 px-3 font-sans">Net Take-Home Cash Profit</td>
              <td class="py-2.5 px-3 font-sans">Delivered profit per order</td>
              <td class="py-2.5 px-3 text-right">₹218.87 (27.4% margin)</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <!-- H3: Multi-Marketplace Benchmarking & Scaling -->
      <h3 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900 pt-2 border-t border-neutral-100">
        Multi-Channel Comparison: Flipkart vs Amazon vs Meesho
      </h3>
      <p>
        Experienced e-commerce brands rarely depend on a single channel. To diversify sales velocity, benchmark your product listings across platforms using our <a href="/amazon-profit-calculator/" class="text-emerald-700 underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-emerald-900 font-medium">Amazon profit calculator</a> and zero-commission <a href="/meesho-profit-calculator/" class="text-emerald-700 underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-emerald-900 font-medium">Meesho seller calculator</a>:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-neutral-600">
        <li><strong>Flipkart Tier Advantage:</strong> Upgrading from Bronze to Gold status slashes shipping fees by ₹15 to ₹20 per order, directly boosting your clean <a href="/net-profit-calculator/" class="text-emerald-700 underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-emerald-900 font-medium">net profit calculator</a> take-home earnings.</li>
        <li><strong>Capital Velocity:</strong> Before committing inventory funds to new Flipkart listings, evaluate working capital yields using our <a href="/product-roi-calculator/" class="text-emerald-700 underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-emerald-900 font-medium">product ROI calculator</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>Return Mitigation:</strong> Cash on Delivery (COD) returns on Flipkart typically carry customer return shipping fees of ₹110 to ₹140. Set minimum margin thresholds using our <a href="/profit-margin-calculator/" class="text-emerald-700 underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-emerald-900 font-medium">profit margin calculator</a> to absorb return write-offs safely.</li>
      </ul>

      <p class="pt-2">
        Bookmark this free <strong>flipkart profit calculator</strong> to simulate order payouts, optimize category pricing, and safeguard your marketplace margins.
      </p>

